---
import SwissFigure from "../development-at-the-speed-of-thought/SwissFigure.astro";
---

<SwissFigure
  height={176}
  label="Handy's pipeline, all on your machine: the microphone, then Silero voice activity detection, which cuts the silence, then a Whisper or Parakeet model that transcribes, then the text is pasted at the cursor. Whisper models use the GPU when one is available; Parakeet V3 is optimized for the CPU."
>
  <rect class="ghost" x="12" y="42" width="296" height="80" rx="3" fill="none"
  ></rect>
  <text class="k acc" x="20" y="34">your machine</text>

  <!-- mic, drawn as the header's waveform bars -->
  <rect class="box" x="20" y="58" width="52" height="38" rx="2"></rect>
  <g class="bar">
    <rect x="28" y="72" width="3" height="10" rx="1"></rect>
    <rect x="34" y="66" width="3" height="22" rx="1"></rect>
    <rect x="40" y="69" width="3" height="16" rx="1"></rect>
    <rect x="46" y="64" width="3" height="26" rx="1"></rect>
    <rect x="52" y="70" width="3" height="14" rx="1"></rect>
    <rect x="58" y="74" width="3" height="6" rx="1"></rect>
  </g>
  <text class="mut" x="20" y="112" font-size="9">you speak</text>

  <path class="wire" d="M72,77 H82"></path>
  <rect class="box" x="82" y="58" width="56" height="38" rx="2"></rect>
  <text x="90" y="74" font-size="10">Silero</text>
  <text x="90" y="87" font-size="10">VAD</text>
  <text class="mut" x="82" y="112" font-size="9">cut silence</text>

  <path class="wire" d="M138,77 H148"></path>
  <rect class="boxa" x="148" y="58" width="76" height="38" rx="2"></rect>
  <text class="acc" x="156" y="74" font-size="10">Whisper /</text>
  <text class="acc" x="156" y="87" font-size="10">Parakeet</text>
  <text class="mut" x="148" y="112" font-size="9">transcribe</text>

  <path class="wire" d="M224,77 H234"></path>
  <rect class="box" x="234" y="58" width="66" height="38" rx="2"></rect>
  <text x="240" y="74" font-size="10">paste</text>
  <text x="240" y="87" font-size="10">at cursor</text>
  <text class="mut" x="234" y="112" font-size="9">text out</text>

  <text class="mut" x="20" y="142" font-size="9"
    >Whisper: GPU when there is one.</text
  >
  <text class="mut" x="20" y="156" font-size="9"
    >Parakeet V3: optimized for the CPU.</text
  >

  <Fragment slot="caption">
    Handy's whole design in four steps. The voice activity detector drops the
    silence first, so the model only ever sees speech.
  </Fragment>
</SwissFigure>
